    "status:   proven = fully tested on silicon with the current code (green);",
    "          restructured = ran on silicon, but the code changed since (amber);",
    "          never = never ran on silicon (red).",
    "offboard: false = no test without a board covers it (hollow ring).",
    "blocks:   the board-run blocks (tools/board_run.py, R0..R7) that exercise it -",
    "          'gen_architecture.py --apply-run <zip>' turns a box green when every one",
    "          of them passed in B with no deviation (tools/eval_board.py) and 'open' is empty.",
    "          An empty list: no board-run block reaches it, it cannot turn green that way.",
    "open:     parts in scope that no test reaches yet (docs/TEST-COVERAGE.md) - while",
    "          any is listed the box stays as it is; remove one when a test covers it.",
    "files:    its source files - a green box whose files changed since 'rev' is drawn",
    "          amber again (the code changed after it was tested).",
    "rev/run:  written by --apply-run: the B image's git revision and the session zip."
